    slug: "perioral-aesthetics-and-skin-health",
    title: "Perioral Aesthetics and Skin Health Literacy for Clinicians",
    excerpt: "The perioral region ages visibly and influences smile outcomes. Learn why skin health literacy matters for clinicians and how professional skincare education builds it.",
    author: AUTHOR,
