    slug: "theory-simulation-supervised-practice-aesthetics",
    title: "Theory, Simulation and Supervised Practice in Aesthetic Education",
    excerpt: "Why aesthetic training should progress from theoretical instruction to simulation and then supervised practice, and how advanced specialist programs structure that progression.",
    author: AUTHOR,
