    slug: "live-model-training-in-injectable-education",
    title: "The Role and Ethics of Live-Model Practice in Injectable Education",
    excerpt: "How supervised live-model practice supports injectable aesthetic education, the ethical safeguards involved, and what Ontario regulations mean for dentists and other professionals.",
