    slug: "what-a-botox-filler-certification-covers",
    title: "What a Botox and Filler Certification Course Typically Covers",
    excerpt: "A walkthrough of the core components of a five-day Botox and filler certification course for health professionals: anatomy, pharmacology, technique, consultation, and complications.",
