    slug: "who-can-take-botox-filler-training-ontario",
    title: "Who Can Take Botox and Filler Training in Ontario?",
    excerpt: "An eligibility guide to Botox and filler training in Ontario: which medical professionals can enrol and clinically apply it, and why a certificate does not authorize practice.",
