    slug: "how-to-contact-and-tour-a-training-institute",
    title: "Why You Should Contact and Tour a Training Institute Before Enrolling",
    excerpt: "A practical guide for healthcare professionals on why to reach out, ask questions, and tour an aesthetics training provider before enrolling, and what to ask.",
